  "text": "On top of those big three, MCP is also bidirectional, meaning communication is not strictly one way. Your AI host can set strict folder boundaries so a server only touches approved directories. Meanwhile, a server can pause mid-task to ask you a clarifying question when details are missing, or politely ask the host's AI for help with a quick subtask.",
